/pull/109142.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:16Z"},"body":"There are some instances when playing particles \"artificially\" (seeking) where particles need to process, but also need to not emit. For example, if there's a oneshot particle that emits for 0.2s and the lifetime is 1s, we will have a total of 1.2s of play time.\r\nBut there was currently no way to do that 1s lifetime, in a single frame, without emitting for the whole 1.2s.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability to actually seek the particle system to both a state when it's emitting, and a state where it's still processing but not emitting, in a single frame.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109142/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}